MiniJV880-CardRAM License Notice
================================

MiniJV880-CardRAM is a modified source distribution derived from the
Mini-JV880 / Mini-JV880pi family of projects.

This repository contains source code only.

It does not include Roland ROMs, SR-JV80 ROMs, SysEx sound banks,
CardRAM images containing sound data, compiled firmware images,
SD-card images, or any other Roland copyrighted sound material.

License structure
-----------------

This project contains code derived from multiple upstream projects.

1. Nuked-SC55-derived emulator code

   Files derived from Nuked-SC55 remain under the original MAME license
   terms used by Nuked-SC55.

   The original MAME license terms include, among other conditions, a
   non-commercial restriction. Redistributions may not be sold, nor may
   they be used in a commercial product or activity.

   The relevant copyright/license notices are preserved in the affected
   source files.

2. GPL-3.0-covered code

   The remaining project code, including code derived from MiniDexed and
   Mini-JV880pi where applicable, is distributed under the GNU General
   Public License version 3.

3. Third-party submodules

   This repository references external submodules such as CMSIS_5 and
   circle-stdlib. These projects are not authored by this repository and
   remain governed by their own upstream licenses.

No warranty
-----------

This software is provided as-is, without any warranty. Use it at your own
risk.

Important note about ROMs and sound data
----------------------------------------

This repository does not provide ROM files or sound content.

Users are responsible for obtaining and using any required ROMs, SR-JV80
expansion images, SysEx banks or CardRAM images legally, according to the
laws and licenses that apply in their jurisdiction.
